         <div n="1">
            <head>Shiji III: Hereditary Houses</head>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of Kang Shu of Wey</title>: In the <span corresp="thirty-first_year_of_Lord_Huai">thirty-first year of <persName n="39">Lord Huai</persName></span>, he went to court in <placeName n="10">Wei</placeName>, and Wei imprisoned and killed Lord Huai. Wei instead set up the younger brother of <persName n="69">Lord Si</persName>: this was <persName n="45">Lord Yuan</persName>. Lord Yuan was a son-in-law of Wei, and so Wei set him up.</p>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of Zhao</title>: In the <span corresp="fourteenth_year">fourteenth year</span>, <persName n="19">Lord Pingyuan, Zhao Sheng</persName>, died.</p>
         </div>

